<u>24-AUG-2004 23:36 (Hong Kong Time)</u>
I'd like to call today, Markets and Temples Day, because that describes exactly what we did today.  We started out going to the Bird Garden.  It's a marketplace known to sell birds in cages.  Birds are a sign of good luck according to Chinese beliefs.  
<p>
<img src="Graphics/spacer.gif" height="60" width="15">
<p>
