<p>
Just down the road is the Flower Street Market.  The shops on this street are dedicated to selling beautiful flowers.  There were several orchids at rock bottom prices ($3 USD) which I wanted to take with me but I couldn't.  They normally cost $20-$30 USD in the USA.
<p>
